The code also includes a CRC32 checksum calculation function and a main async function (`run`) to demonstrate how to use the created context object. This solution utilizes mutexes to ensure thread safety, handles potential external data source failures gracefully by providing fallback strategies for initializing CRC values, and is designed to be scalable and modular for easy extension.']

