The code uses GZip and ZIP compression formats for data deserialization, and ensures efficient memory usage in large-scale testing environments by optimizing memory allocation, minimizing fragmentation, and cache inefficiencies. It also incorporates a seeded random number generator to ensure test reproducibility while avoiding predictable sequences.

