To further optimize this implementation, you may consider using lock-free data structures, such as linked lists with compare-and-swap (CAS) operations, or fine-grained locks to minimize contention and latency. Additionally, integrating with an external logging system for tracking memory usage patterns can provide insights for additional optimization efforts.']

